# Pokemon Ruby (USA, Europe, Rev 2): title screen to the player's own house in Littleroot Town, the player in play (gate G9, route depth; the real-time clock cartridge).
# Start and A taps from frame 300 to 5,200 (the title, new game, Birch's talk, the boy, the name, the moving van), no key while the van runs, Right held from 6,300 (the door is open; Littleroot Town, Mom talks), then A taps from 6,900 to 9,000 to follow her into the house.
# The player is in the living room, Mom and the Zigzagoon beside, from about frame 9,000; the frame limit is 9,400. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
